OL,3,ASpoiler alert! Is social media ruining
OL,4,Abig gig surprises?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonths before you have a chance to see
OL,7,Fyour favourite artist, chances are you
OL,8,Falready know some of the big moments
OL,9,Fthey have planned.
OL,11,FYou'll also probably know the set list,
OL,12,Fthe stage design, and - if you've
OL,13,Freally been paying attention - where to
OL,14,Fstand to get the best view.
OL,16,FWhen it comes to films and TV series,
OL,17,Fspoilers tend to be guarded against
OL,18,Fwith warnings.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
